<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom cellular unit H1 net up.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom cellular unit H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30.</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  5.72    vs    2.0</p>
<p>    Cashflow	    8.6     vs    4.8</p>
<p>Note - TMN is the cellular phone subsidiary of Portugal Telecom.  </p>
<p>    Sales			32.00   vs     16.20</p>
<p>    Number of clients    431,631   vs   213,788</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
